# Adoption of the canon's Go mutation leg (monumental-archive/.github
# #1356): gomu reads this file, and tracking it at the root opts stele
# into the weekly mutation run (.github/workflows/mutants.yml).
#
# It holds NO pattern, by rule: a pattern drops whole files from the run
# and from the count. An equivalent mutant is recorded at its site
# instead, with its reason:
#
#   //mutants:equivalent <type> <reason>
